<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
  <%- include('include/header', { title: "알림 설정" }) %>

  <body>
    <main class="page">
      <section class="section">
        <h1 class="logo">알림 설정</h1>

        <div class="card card--auth notifications-card">
          <div class="notifications-card__section">
            <h2 class="notifications-card__title">데스크톱 알림</h2>
            <p class="muted notifications-card__desc">
              다른 탭을 보거나 화면이 잠겨 있을 때 새 메시지를 OS 알림으로 받습니다.
            </p>
            <p class="notifications-card__status" id="desktopStatus"></p>
            <div class="row row--gap-sm" style="margin-top: 1rem">
              <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" id="enableDesktopBtn">
                알림 켜기
              </button>
              <button type="button" class="btn btn--secondary" id="disableDesktopBtn" hidden>
                알림 끄기
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <hr class="notifications-card__divider" />

          <div class="notifications-card__section">
            <h2 class="notifications-card__title">푸시 알림 (모바일·백그라운드)</h2>
            <p class="muted notifications-card__desc">
              브라우저가 백그라운드이거나 모바일에서도 알림을 받을 수 있습니다.
              서버에 VAPID 키가 설정되어 있어야 활성화됩니다.
            </p>
            <p class="notifications-card__status" id="pushStatus"></p>
            <div class="row row--gap-sm" style="margin-top: 1rem">
              <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" id="enablePushBtn" hidden>
                푸시 구독
              </button>
              <button type="button" class="btn btn--secondary" id="disablePushBtn" hidden>
                푸시 해제
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="row row--gap-sm" style="margin-top: 1.5rem">
            <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/dashboard">대시보드로 돌아가기</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('include/footer') %>
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="alertModalOverlay">
      <div class="modal" id="alertModal">
        <h2>Notice</h2>
        <p id="alertModalMsg"></p>
        <button onclick="closeAlertModal()">확인</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <script>
      window.__NOTIFICATIONS__ = {
        pushConfigured: <%- JSON.stringify(Boolean(pushConfigured)) %>
      };
    </script>
    <script src="/js/common.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/chat-notifications.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/notifications-settings.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
